"审批资源","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/govern-at-scale/establish-ai-managers","title":"建立 AI 经理","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/govern-at-scale/govern-for-adoption","title":"治理以推动采用","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/govern-at-scale/pilot-a-feature-or-model","title":"试点功能或模型","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/govern-at-scale/maintain-codebase-standards","title":"维护基本代码标准","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers","title":"赋能开发人员","childPages":[{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/drive-adoption","title":"推动采用","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/copilot-app-for-teams","title":"推出 Copilot 应用","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/integrate-ai-agents","title":"集成 AI 代理","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/enable-developers/drive-team-agentic-adoption","title":"推动代理采用","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact","title":"推动下游影响","childPages":[{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/achieve-company-goals","title":"实现公司目标","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/increase-test-coverage","title":"提高测试覆盖率","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/accelerate-pull-requests","title":"加速处理拉取请求","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/drive-downstream-impact/reduce-security-debt","title":"减少安全债务","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/measure-copilot-impact","title":"Copilot 使用情况指标","childPages":[],"layout":"journey-landing"},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/roll-out-at-scale/measure-success","title":"衡量试用成功率","childPages":[]}]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/explore-a-codebase","title":"探索代码库","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/explore-issues-and-discussions","title":"探究议题和讨论","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/explore-pull-requests","title":"探索拉取请求","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/write-tests","title":"编写测试","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/optimize-ai-usage","title":"优化 AI 使用情况","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/optimize-chat-usage","title":"优化聊天使用情况","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/optimize-code-reviews","title":"优化代码评审","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/reduce-technical-debt","title":"减少技术债务","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/stack-ai-generated-code-in-pull-requests","title":"Stack AI 合并请求","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/review-ai-generated-code","title":"查看 AI 代码","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/vibe-coding","title":"Vibe 编码","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/copilot-cli-hooks","title":"在 Copilot CLI 中使用钩子功能","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/use-an-ai-sme","title":"使用 AI SME","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials/create-an-extension","title":"创建 CLI 扩展","childPages":[]}],"sidebarLink":{"text":"All tutorials","href":"/zh/copilot/tutorials"},"layout":"bespoke-landing"},{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use","title":"负责任使用","childPages":[{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use/chat","title":"聊天","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use/inline-suggestions","title":"内联建议","childPages":[]},{"href":"/zh/copilot/responsible-use/agents","title":"智能体","childPages":[]}]}],"layout":"discovery-landing"},"status":200,"xHost":"docs.github.com"},"articleContext":{"title":"GitHub Copilot中的请求（旧版）","intro":"\u003cp\u003e了解 Copilot 中的请求，包括高级请求、它们的工作方式以及如何有效管理您的使用情况。\u003c/p\u003e","effectiveDate":"","renderedPage":"\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-done\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e重要\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e 本文仅适用于现有年度计划中在 2026 年 6 月 1 日之后仍使用旧版基于高级请求计费方式的 Copilot Pro 和 Copilot Pro+ 订阅者。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"what-is-a-request\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#what-is-a-request\"\u003e什么是请求？\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e请求是你要求 Copilot 你执行某些操作的任何交互，无论是生成代码、回答问题还是帮助你完成扩展。 每次在聊天窗口中发送提示或触发来自 Copilot的响应时，都会发出请求。 对于代理特征，只有您发送的提示会被视为高级请求；而操作 Copilot 为完成任务自动执行的操作，例如工具调用，则不计入。 例如，使用 \u003ccode\u003e/plan\u003c/code\u003e 在 Copilot CLI 中会被计作一个高级请求，您发送的任何后续提示则被视为另一个请求。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"what-are-premium-requests\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#what-are-premium-requests\"\u003e什么是高级请求？\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e某些 Copilot 功能使用更高级的处理能力，并计入高级请求。 某个功能使用的高级请求数可能有所不同，具体取决于所使用的功能和 AI 模型。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"premium-features\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#premium-features\"\u003e高级功能\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e以下 Copilot 功能可以使用高级请求。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-done\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e重要\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n从 2026 年 6 月 1 日开始， Copilot code review 模型乘数将为 13。 这意味着每次 Copilot 审阅拉取请求或在你的 IDE 中审阅代码时，你的每月 Copilot 高级请求配额将减少 13。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-tool rowheaders\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctable\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e功能\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e高级请求消耗量\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003eSKU 归属\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/how-tos/copilot-in-your-ide/chat-with-copilot\"\u003eCopilot Chat\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot Chat 对每个用户提示使用\u003cstrong\u003e一次高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e，并乘以模型的费率。 这包括 IDE 中的 Copilot Chat 请求、编辑、代理和计划模式。\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot 付费请求\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/copilot-surfaces/copilot-cli\"\u003eCopilot CLI\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot CLI 的每个提示将使用默认模型的\u003cstrong\u003e一个高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e。 对于其他模型，这乘以模型的速率。\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot 付费请求\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review\"\u003eCopilot 代码评审\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e每次 Copilot 审查拉取请求（当被分配为审阅者时）或审查 IDE 中的代码时，都会消耗 \u003cstrong\u003e13 次高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e。\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCopilot 付费请求\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/copilot-surfaces/copilot-on-github\"\u003eCopilot cloud agent\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot cloud agent 每个会话使用\u003cstrong\u003e一个高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e，乘以模型的费率。 当提示 Copilot 执行任务时，会开始会话。 此外，在活动会话期间发出的每条实时指导评论，每个会话使用\u003cstrong\u003e一个高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e，乘以模型的速率。\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot cloud agent 付费请求\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/prompting-and-context/spaces\"\u003eCopilot Spaces\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot Spaces 对每个用户提示使用\u003cstrong\u003e一次高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e，并乘以模型的费率。\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003eCopilot 付费请求\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/agent-capabilities/about-agents/about-third-party-coding-agents#vs-code-extension\"\u003eOpenAI CodexVisual Studio Code 集成\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e在预览版中，OpenAI Codex 的每个提示使用\u003cstrong\u003e一个高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e乘以模型乘数费率。\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCopilot 付费请求\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/agent-capabilities/about-agents/about-third-party-coding-agents\"\u003e第三方编码代理\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e在预览版中，每次向第三方编码智能体发送提示消耗的请求数量是 \u003cstrong\u003e1 次高级请求\u003c/strong\u003e乘以模型的倍率。\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCopilot 付费请求\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-accent\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e注意\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n从 2025 年 11 月 1 日开始，针对Spark和Copilot cloud agent的高级请求将在专用 SKU 中进行跟踪。 这为每个 AI 产品提供更好的成本可见性和预算控制。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-success\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M8 1.5c-2.363 0-4 1.69-4 3.75 0 .984.424 1.625.984 2.304l.214.253c.223.264.47.556.673.848.284.411.537.896.621 1.49a.75.75 0 0 1-1.484.211c-.04-.282-.163-.547-.37-.847a8.456 8.456 0 0 0-.542-.68c-.084-.1-.173-.205-.268-.32C3.201 7.75 2.5 6.766 2.5 5.25 2.5 2.31 4.863 0 8 0s5.5 2.31 5.5 5.25c0 1.516-.701 2.5-1.328 3.259-.095.115-.184.22-.268.319-.207.245-.383.453-.541.681-.208.3-.33.565-.37.847a.751.751 0 0 1-1.485-.212c.084-.593.337-1.078.621-1.489.203-.292.45-.584.673-.848.075-.088.147-.173.213-.253.561-.679.985-1.32.985-2.304 0-2.06-1.637-3.75-4-3.75ZM5.75 12h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM6 15.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e提示\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n有关查看已使用的高级请求数以及使用情况优化方式相关建议的说明，请参阅“\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/reference/copilot-billing/request-based-billing-legacy/monitor-premium-requests\"\u003e监控 GitHub Copilot 的使用情况和权益（旧版）\u003c/a\u003e”。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"how-do-request-allowances-work-per-plan\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#how-do-request-allowances-work-per-plan\"\u003e各计划的请求限额是如何运作的？\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-accent\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e注意\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n高级请求的计费从 2025 年 6 月 18 日开始，所有付费的 Copilot 计划从 GitHub.com 开始，到 2025 年 8 月 1 日从 GHE.com 开始。 仅为付费计划将请求计数器重置为零。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e如果你使用的是\u003cstrong\u003e付费计划\u003c/strong\u003e，则可获得无限内联建议。 已设置速率限制以满足高需求。 请参阅“\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/billing-and-usage/individuals/usage-limits\"\u003eGitHub Copilot 的使用限制\u003c/a\u003e”。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e付费计划还每月提供一定额度的高级请求，可用于高级聊天交互、使用高级模型的内联建议以及其他高级功能。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-tool rowheaders\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctable\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003eCopilot Pro\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth scope=\"col\"\u003eCopilot Pro+\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e定价\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e$10 USD 每月\u003cbr\u003e（对某些用户免费）\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e$39 USD 每月\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e付费请求\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e每月 300 个\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e每月 1500 个\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e以每次请求 0.04 美元的价格购买额外的高级请求\u003c/th\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon octicon-check\" aria-label=\"Included\" role=\"img\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon octicon-check\" aria-label=\"Included\" role=\"img\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"what-happens-to-unused-requests-at-the-end-of-the-month\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#what-happens-to-unused-requests-at-the-end-of-the-month\"\u003e月底未使用的请求会怎样？\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e上个月未使用的请求不会结转到下个月。 高级请求计数器在每个月的第一天 00:00:00 UTC 重置。 请参阅“\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/reference/copilot-billing/request-based-billing-legacy/monitor-premium-requests\"\u003e监控 GitHub Copilot 的使用情况和权益（旧版）\u003c/a\u003e”。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"what-if-i-run-out-of-premium-requests\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#what-if-i-run-out-of-premium-requests\"\u003e如果高级请求用完了怎么办？\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ghd-alert ghd-alert-accent\" data-container=\"alert\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ghd-alert-title\"\u003e\u003csvg version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon mr-2\" aria-hidden\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e注意\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n以下用户无法获取额外的高级请求：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e在 iOS 或 Android 上通过 Copilot Pro 订阅或已经订阅 Copilot Pro+ 或 GitHub Mobile 的用户。\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e如果你用完了所有高级请求，当月剩余时间内，你仍然可以使用包含了其中一个内置模型的 Copilot。 此规定可能会有变化。 在高使用率期间，包含的模型的响应时间可能会有所不同。 对包含的模型的请求可能会受到速率限制。 请参阅“\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/concepts/billing-and-usage/individuals/usage-limits\"\u003eGitHub Copilot 的使用限制\u003c/a\u003e”。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e如果您需要超出每月额度的更多高级请求，请为额外的高级请求设置预算，或升级到更高等级的套餐。 请参阅“\u003ca href=\"/zh/billing/how-tos/set-up-budgets\"\u003e设置预算以控制按流量计费的产品的支出\u003c/a\u003e”。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"model-multipliers\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#model-multipliers\"\u003e模型乘数\u003cspan class=\"heading-link-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e每个模型都有一个高级请求乘数，具体取决于其复杂性和资源使用情况。 根据此乘数扣除保费请求津贴。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e请参阅“\u003ca href=\"/zh/copilot/reference/copilot-billing/request-based-billing-legacy/model-multipliers-for-annual-plans\"\u003e按请求计费的年度套餐模型乘数（旧版）\u003c/a\u003e”。\u003c/p\u003e","renderedPageHast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"div","properties":{"className":"ghd-alert ghd-alert-done","dataContainer":"alert"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{"className":["ghd-alert-title"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"version":"1.1","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 16 16","className":["octicon","mr-2"],"ariaHidden":true},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"path","properties":{"d":"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"text","value":"重要"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 本文仅适用于现有年度计划中在 2026 年 6 月 1 日之后仍使用旧版基于高级请求计费方式的 Copilot Pro 和 Copilot Pro+ 订阅者。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"what-is-a-request","tabIndex":-1},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["heading-link"],"href":"#what-is-a-request"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"什么是请求？"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["heading-link-symbol"],"ariaHidden":"true"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"请求是你要求 Copilot 你执行某些操作的任何交互，无论是生成代码、回答问题还是帮助你完成扩展。 每次在聊天窗口中发送提示或触发来自 Copilot的响应时，都会发出请求。 对于代理特征，只有您发送的提示会被视为高级请求；而操作 Copilot 为完成任务自动执行的操作，例如工具调用，则不计入。 例如，使用 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"/plan"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 在 Copilot CLI 中会被计作一个高级请求，您发送的任何后续提示则被视为另一个请求。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"what-are-premium-requests","tabIndex":-1},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["heading-link"],"href":"#what-are-premium-requests"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"什么是高级请求？"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["heading-link-symbol"],"ariaHidden":"true"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"某些 Copilot 功能使用更高级的处理能力，并计入高级请求。 某个功能使用的高级请求数可能有所不同，具体取决于所使用的功能和 AI 模型。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h3","properties":{"id":"premium-features","tabIndex":-1},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["heading-link"],"href":"#premium-features"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"高级功能"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["heading-link-symbol"],"ariaHidden":"true"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"以下 Copilot 功能可以使用高级请求。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"div","properties":{"className":"ghd-alert ghd-alert-done","dataContainer":"alert"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{"className":["ghd-alert-title"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"version":"1.1","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 16 16","className":["octicon","mr-2"],"ariaHidden":true},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"path","properties":{"d":"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"text","value":"重要"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n从 2026 年 6 月 1 日开始， Copilot code review 模型乘数将为 13。 这意味着每次 Copilot 审阅拉取请求或在你的 IDE 中审阅代码时，你的每月 Copilot 高级请求配额将减少 13。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"div","properties":{"className":["ghd-tool","rowheaders"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"table","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"thead","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"col"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"功能"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"col"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"高级请求消耗量"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"col"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"SKU 归属"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"tbody","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/zh/copilot/how-tos/copilot-in-your-ide/chat-with-copilot"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot Chat"}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot Chat 对每个用户提示使用"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一次高级请求"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，并乘以模型的费率。 这包括 IDE 中的 Copilot Chat 请求、编辑、代理和计划模式。"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot 付费请求"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/zh/copilot/concepts/copilot-surfaces/copilot-cli"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot CLI"}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot CLI 的每个提示将使用默认模型的"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一个高级请求"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。 对于其他模型，这乘以模型的速率。"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot 付费请求"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/zh/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot 代码评审"}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"每次 Copilot 审查拉取请求（当被分配为审阅者时）或审查 IDE 中的代码时，都会消耗 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"13 次高级请求"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot 付费请求"}]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/zh/copilot/concepts/copilot-surfaces/copilot-on-github"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot cloud agent"}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[]}],"_scoped":true},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"row"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copilot cloud agent 每个会话使用"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一个高级请求"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，乘以模型的费率。 当提示 Copilot 执行任务时，会开始会话。 此外，在活动会话期间发出的每条实时指导评论，每个会话使用"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"c